// denext (DENEXT.md item 269): a permission refusal from `node:fs` carries
// Node's permission-model fields (`code: "ERR_ACCESS_DENIED"`, `permission`,
// `resource`) plus `syscall` / `path` on the sync, callback and promise
// forms, and stays a `Deno.errors.NotCapable`; Deno's own APIs keep their
// error unchanged.
{
  "args": "run --allow-read=allowed main.mjs",
  "output": "main.out"
}
